>                 are not good as a
>                 > reference. This was all checked in matlab with the
>                 true analytic
>                 > solutions. Maybe it's a good idea to add this as a
>                 unit test as well,
>                 > using the true analytic solution as a reference
>                 instead of the FD
>                 > estimate.
>                 >
>                 > Yes, that would be great to add those as unit tests
>                 as well.
>                 >
>                 >
>                 >
>                 > > 2) doc: at the class level, in the documentation
>                 > >
>                 > The CVODE implementation is a drop-in replacement,
>                 so I kept the
>                 > available documentation. I can surely add more
>                 documentation wherever
>                 > needed.
